Package: wickraterminal
Type: Package
Title: Data-Driven Trading-Terminal Core
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("kingchenc", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "support@wickra.org")
Description: R bindings for wickra-terminal over its C ABI hub: build a Terminal
    from a JSON config, drive it with command JSON and read back the frame JSON
    - the same protocol as the native TUI and every other binding.
Depends: R (>= 3.0.0)
License: MIT + file LICENSE | Apache License 2.0
URL: https://github.com/wickra-lib/wickra-terminal, https://terminal.wickra.org,
    https://wickra-lib.r-universe.dev
BugReports: https://github.com/wickra-lib/wickra-terminal/issues
X-schema.org-keywords: trading, terminal, streaming, market-data, order-book,
    indicators, finance, quant, time-series, technical-analysis
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: yes
SystemRequirements: the wickra-terminal C ABI shared library, downloaded
    automatically at install time from the matching GitHub release and bundled
    into the package. Set WKTERM_INC and WKTERM_LIB to build against a locally
    built C ABI instead (e.g. after `cargo build -p wickra-terminal-c --release`).
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
